+config MT6375_AUXADC
+	tristate "MediaTek MT6375 battery auxiliary ADC"
+	depends on MFD_MT6375
+	help
+	  Enable the battery voltage, battery thermistor and reference voltage
+	  channels in the MediaTek MT6375 companion PMIC. The driver performs
